   5 | chroot /mnt policyctl swappiness 10
     | \_________________________________/

   = help:  sm site runs `chroot /mnt policyctl swappiness 10`
hint: 'chroot' (line 5) is unmodeled: it is the first wall -- an oracle vouching its convergence would elide it when converged
